      "source": "ipgroupplc-news-and-events-portfolio-news-2025-2025-09-19/output.md §Cost comparisons estimates",
      "rationale": "The EM gun driver cost ($2/J for 100 MJ = $200M) already includes the capacitor bank as an integral part of the electromagnetic launcher system. Unlike laser IFE where the bank charges the laser and the laser is a separate cost item, here the bank IS the driver's energy store. Setting to zero avoids double-counting.",
