      "rationale": "Library default ($33.5M) prices remote handling for periodic blanket and first-wall replacement. First Light's liquid lithium curtain eliminates solid in-vessel component replacement ('lifetime-of-plant vessel'). Remaining RH scope: projectile gun access, target injection systems, lithium loop maintenance, diagnostic equipment. 30% of generic ($10.1M) is an analogue estimate — ~70% of conventional RH cost is driven by blanket/first-wall change-out (tokamak cost studies), leaving ~30% for other in-vessel and ex-vessel handling needs.",
